<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="446549369"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1700845442"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Spirals (William Black Remix)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ILLENIUM / Sound Remedy / Dana Salah"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Ashes (Remixes)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:42.600"><div begin="00:13.780" end="03:42.600"><p begin="00:13.780" end="00:19.430" itunes:key="L1">Remember when you asked me to paint you all my dreams<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还记得你让我将你绘入我的梦中</span></p><p begin="00:19.430" end="00:26.390" itunes:key="L2">I told you a sailboat no compass just us and an open sea<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我说我们就像是乘着一只没有罗盘的帆船 广阔的海面上只有你我两人</span></p><p begin="00:26.390" end="00:29.750" itunes:key="L3">I'll sing like a siren, our island is floating<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会如塞任般歌唱 属于我们的小岛正随波逐流</span></p><p begin="00:29.750" end="00:34.860" itunes:key="L4">The sail in the blue sky is our only curtain<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">蓝天下的风帆是我们唯一的帷幔</span></p><p begin="00:34.860" end="00:36.710" itunes:key="L5">I'll show you a spiral<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会让你看到一个漩涡</span></p><p begin="00:36.710" end="00:41.580" itunes:key="L6">Staircase that only your eyes can see<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一个只有你可以看到的旋转楼梯</span></p><p begin="00:41.580" end="00:45.870" itunes:key="L7">I'll spin your walls around<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会在你的心墙外徘徊</span></p><p begin="00:45.870" end="00:48.390" itunes:key="L8">Around like spirals<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如漩涡一般</span></p><p begin="00:48.390" end="00:52.810" itunes:key="L9">Won't you go all the way down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你不打算和我一起沉溺爱河吗</span></p><p begin="00:52.810" end="00:56.900" itunes:key="L10">Down like spirals, like spirals<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如沉溺在涡流中一般 无法自拔</span></p><p begin="00:56.900" end="01:02.020" itunes:key="L11">Like spiral stairs to a cave by the ocean<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就好像顺着旋转楼梯 走入大海的洞穴</span></p><p begin="01:02.020" end="01:06.690" itunes:key="L12">Unravel all for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为你解决一切</span></p><p begin="01:06.690" end="01:37.260" itunes:key="L13">All for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">解决一切</span></p><p begin="01:37.260" end="01:43.450" itunes:key="L14">All for you</p><p begin="02:17.120" end="02:23.130" itunes:key="L15">Remember when our paradise was green grapevines and leaves<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还记得当我们的乐土满是绿色的葡萄藤和树叶时</span></p><p begin="02:23.130" end="02:29.750" itunes:key="L16">Do you remember when the shorelines grew for you and me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你还记得海岸线是在何时为了你我而延长的吗</span></p><p begin="02:29.750" end="02:33.500" itunes:key="L17">I'll build you a house where the hallways will always<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会为你建造一所房子 那栋房子的走廊</span></p><p begin="02:33.500" end="02:38.310" itunes:key="L18">Lead you to bedrooms where i will be waiting<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是会带你走向我一直在等待你的卧室</span></p><p begin="02:38.310" end="02:40.240" itunes:key="L19">I'll show you a spiral<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会让你看到一个漩涡</span></p><p begin="02:40.240" end="02:45.000" itunes:key="L20">Staircase that only your eyes can see<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一个只有你可以看到的旋转楼梯</span></p><p begin="02:45.000" end="02:49.240" itunes:key="L21">I'll spin your walls around<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会在你的心墙外徘徊</span></p><p begin="02:49.240" end="02:51.820" itunes:key="L22">Around like spirals<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如漩涡一般</span></p><p begin="02:51.820" end="02:56.370" itunes:key="L23">Won't you go all the way down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你不打算和我一起沉溺爱河吗</span></p><p begin="02:56.370" end="03:00.310" itunes:key="L24">Down like spirals, like spirals<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如沉溺在涡流中一般 无法自拔</span></p><p begin="03:00.310" end="03:05.530" itunes:key="L25">Like spiral stairs to a cave by the ocean<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就好像顺着旋转楼梯 走入大海的洞穴</span></p><p begin="03:05.530" end="03:10.020" itunes:key="L26">Unravel all for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为你解决一切</span></p><p begin="03:10.020" end="03:40.630" itunes:key="L27">All for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">解决一切</span></p><p begin="03:40.630" end="03:42.600" itunes:key="L28">All for you</p></div></body></tt>